        "TileImage": "$($repository d6bb15bf-f4a4-4c96-ab65-8a3560a9dc45).Image",
        "Description": "It’s been a hot minute since we started HITMAN 3 – Year 2 and we’ve just reached the 3-month mark. A great time for us to give a deeper update on what’s coming up in the rest of the year.\rIf you’ve just joined the World of Assassination, or need a recap on what Year 2 is all about, you can catch up on the plans we shared earlier this year. Today, we want to give an update on these exciting updates and when you can expect them to arrive in the game.\r\r\rBy Agent Banner",
